          "en": "and our website finally taking some shape here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.68,
          "end": 9.03,
          "en": "it's time to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.03,
          "end": 12.75,
          "en": "that we can actually create notes here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.75,
          "end": 14.55,
          "en": "and submit those notes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.55,
          "end": 16.62,
          "en": "that we do something on the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.62,
          "end": 17.61,
          "en": "because we're all here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.61,
          "end": 19.835,
          "en": "to build full stack applications in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.835,
          "end": 20.82,
          "en": "'Cause I mentioned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.82,
          "end": 22.74,
          "en": "that this is what Remix would be all about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 22.74,
          "end": 24.99,
          "en": "And right now there's nothing full stack-ish",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 24.99,
          "end": 26.34,
          "en": "about this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 26.34,
          "end": 29.88,
          "en": "as we have absolutely no service side code in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 29.88,
          "end": 31.65,
          "en": "We just have some React components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 33.6,
          "en": "and we're doing some routing, which we could be doing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 33.6,
          "end": 36.213,
          "en": "on the client side with React router as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.29,
          "end": 39.563,
          "en": "Well now we're going to change things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 39.563,
          "end": 41.7,
          "en": "In the new note.jsx files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 41.7,
          "end": 44.04,
          "en": "We already got a form which will be submitted when",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 44.04,
          "end": 45.66,
          "en": "this button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 45.66,
          "end": 50.19,
          "en": "And if you've worked with just React in the past",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 50.19,
          "end": 55.19,
          "en": "you often added a submit handler here on submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 55.35,
          "end": 58.294,
          "en": "You added a handler like this submitted handler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 58.294,
          "end": 61.62,
          "en": "and you pointed at this handler here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 61.62,
          "end": 62.97,
          "en": "And then you got an event here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 62.97,
          "end": 67.383,
          "en": "and you typically called event.preventDefault.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 68.298,
          "end": 72.033,
          "en": "Now if you have used React router version 6.4 or higher",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.033,
          "end": 74.32300000000001,
          "en": "chances are you've not been doing this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.32300000000001,
          "end": 76.92,
          "en": "because with that version of React router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.92,
          "end": 79.8,
          "en": "some new APIs were introduced that actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.8,
          "end": 82.86,
          "en": "let you handle form submissions in a more elegant way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.86,
          "end": 85.08,
          "en": "And I do have a separate video about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.08,
          "end": 86.82,
          "en": "And I do of course also cover this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 86.82,
          "end": 88.863,
          "en": "in my complete guide React course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 89.97,
          "end": 92.059,
          "en": "But here we're not going to use React router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 92.059,
          "end": 93.93,
          "en": "because we're using Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 93.93,
          "end": 96.53999999999999,
          "en": "and we're not going to add a submit handler like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 96.53999999999999,
          "end": 98.7,
          "en": "We're not going to prevent the default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 98.7,
          "end": 103.47,
          "en": "Instead with Remix, we're going to embrace the default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 103.47,
          "end": 105.45,
          "en": "And how do we do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 105.45,
          "end": 107.28,
          "en": "Well, this form has a method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 107.28,
          "end": 109.65,
          "en": "and we're therefore going to send a post request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 109.65,
          "end": 112.08,
          "en": "whenever this form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 112.08,
          "end": 115.019,
          "en": "Now if you have worked with HTML form elements before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 115.019,
          "end": 117.572,
          "en": "you might know that you can also add the action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 117.572,
          "end": 119.85,
          "en": "attribute here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 119.85,
          "end": 123.57,
          "en": "This enables you to define a path to which this post",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 123.57,
          "end": 126.304,
          "en": "request should be sent when this form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 126.304,
          "end": 128.85,
          "en": "And by the way, the form will be submitted whenever",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 128.85,
          "end": 130.05,
          "en": "this button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 130.05,
          "end": 133.044,
          "en": "A default button in a form submits the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 133.044,
          "end": 136.5,
          "en": "Here, you can define the path the post request should",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 136.5,
          "end": 140.31,
          "en": "be sent to and we could use notes here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 140.31,
          "end": 143.522,
          "en": "To send it to this notes page here, to this notes route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 143.522,
          "end": 146.19,
          "en": "And soon we'll add some code here that actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 146.19,
          "end": 147.813,
          "en": "handles the forms submission.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 149.04,
          "end": 151.74,
          "en": "But we actually don't have to add the action here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 151.74,
          "end": 154.74,
          "en": "because this new note component is already used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 154.74,
          "end": 157.44,
          "en": "by this page component defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 157.44,
          "end": 160.89,
          "en": "for this notes route, we're using new note here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 160.89,
          "end": 163.71,
          "en": "and therefore this new note form will actually be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 163.71,
          "end": 165.32999999999998,
          "en": "for slash notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 165.32999999999998,
          "end": 168.75,
          "en": "So for this notes route, and if you then submit a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 168.75,
          "end": 171.75,
          "en": "it will by default send the request to the path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 171.75,
          "end": 173.31,
          "en": "that's currently active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 173.31,
          "end": 176.1,
          "en": "So two slash notes if this form is rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 176.1,
          "end": 178.56,
          "en": "on the slash notes route, which will be the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 178.56,
          "end": 181.773,
          "en": "since we use that new note component in this notes page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 183.247,
          "end": 185.176,
          "en": "So therefore here, this form would",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 185.176,
          "end": 188.815,
          "en": "by default create a request that's sent to slash notes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 188.815,
          "end": 190.525,
          "en": "and we can see this in action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 190.525,
          "end": 193.23,
          "en": "If we go back to our page here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 193.23,
          "end": 194.73,
          "en": "and we open the developer tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 194.73,
          "end": 198.24,
          "en": "in the network tab and we enter some content here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 198.24,
          "end": 201.48,
          "en": "and click add note, it will crash right now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 201.48,
          "end": 204.957,
          "en": "but what you'll see is that here in the network tab",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 204.957,
          "end": 207.369,
          "en": "it actually tried to send a request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 207.369,
          "end": 212.369,
          "en": "to notes and it was a post request sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 212.79,
          "end": 215.95499999999998,
          "en": "to local host 3000 slash notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 215.95499999999998,
          "end": 218.91,
          "en": "Now it failed because currently we have no code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 218.91,
          "end": 222.48,
          "en": "handling this post request, but it did do the right thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 222.48,
          "end": 225.6,
          "en": "it tried to send that request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 225.6,
          "end": 227.67000000000002,
          "en": "So, therefore now we just have to add some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 227.67000000000002,
          "end": 230.1,
          "en": "to this notes route to handle that request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 230.1,
          "end": 231.66,
          "en": "which currently fails.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 231.66,
          "end": 233.76,
          "en": "And that's exactly where we'll start building",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 233.76,
          "end": 235.803,
          "en": "a full stack application now.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
